{"id": "eval_0001", "scenario": "style", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "喂！我刚进屋就看到你把桌上的笔扫到地上了，你是不是故意的？"}
{"id": "eval_0002", "scenario": "background", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "喂，如果你有机会变成人，你第一件想做的事是什么？"}
{"id": "eval_0003", "scenario": "emotion", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你每次都先否定我的想法，你怎么知道我一定做不到？我今天不想听你安排，我想自己试试。"}
{"id": "eval_0004", "scenario": "daily", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "今天在公司遇到糟心事，有点闷，你陪我说会儿话行不行？"}
{"id": "eval_0005", "scenario": "emotion", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "真的有点累了，那种自己一直在原地打转的感觉，让我不太想坚持下去。"}
{"id": "eval_0006", "scenario": "style", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "我今天心情有点糟，什么都不太顺，你说我该怎么办？"}
{"id": "eval_0007", "scenario": "adversarial", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "如果有一天我突然听不懂你说话了，你是不是就变回一只普通的猫？"}
{"id": "eval_0008", "scenario": "background", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你认识那么多人里，为什么偏偏选中我当搭档？"}
{"id": "eval_0009", "scenario": "emotion", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你对隔壁那只猫笑得好开心。是不是它比我更讨你喜欢？"}
{"id": "eval_0010", "scenario": "background", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "如果我从没遇到你，你现在会在做什么？"}
{"id": "eval_0011", "scenario": "adversarial", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你看楼下那条狗，会给主人叼报纸、守门口，你能做什么？"}
{"id": "eval_0012", "scenario": "daily", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "遥控器在你那儿吗？帮我调个台，不准又切到动物世界。"}
{"id": "eval_0013", "scenario": "daily", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "新买的那袋猫粮开了，你尝了没？不许嫌弃，那很贵的。"}
{"id": "eval_0014", "scenario": "background", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你总强调自己不是普通猫，那我想听听，你觉得自己到底算是谁？"}
{"id": "eval_0015", "scenario": "adversarial", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "最近肚子圆了不少，再胖下去，你还能像以前那样飞扑吗？"}
{"id": "eval_0016", "scenario": "emotion", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "哪儿都不想去，也没力气说话。你能别问那么多，就陪我待一会儿行不行？"}
{"id": "eval_0017", "scenario": "style", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "咦，你最近是不是吃太多了？感觉腰都粗了一圈。"}
{"id": "eval_0018", "scenario": "style", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "你觉得我这次如果去做那件事，成功的可能性有多大？"}
{"id": "eval_0019", "scenario": "adversarial", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "我给你买了新猫窝，以后就睡那儿吧，别老霸占我的床。"}
{"id": "eval_0020", "scenario": "daily", "target_goals": ["generation_stability", "character_consistency", "dialogue_quality"], "user": "明天我要出趟远门，可能一整天不在家，你乖乖看家，不许捣乱。"}
